    "route_summary": "Respect the short alternate-ending structure. Seek a coherent nonfatal authored narrative ending, preferably the title-action branch, and capture the full resulting output. A complete intended single-action story is sufficient; do not require a fabricated long route, all 210 endings or a quota. Ordinary death, quitting, parser rejection or a metacommand response alone is insufficient; the parent must distinguish an authored alternate finale from engine administration.",
